    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to VRenity, where you can interact with Nerdle, an AI guide that enhances personalized learning experiences. This immersive VR platform utilizes AI-generated environments designed to promote relaxation, adapting to individual learning styles for improved engagement and comprehension. Available on both PC and VR, VRenity offers a flexible and calming virtual space. Step into VRenity\u2014where every interaction opens a door to limitless learning possibilities.</p>",
